/// `fa -p`/bench), never off the approval mode: an interactive TUI session
/// stays contract-free under EVERY approval mode, including autopilot
/// (`ApprovalMode.unattended`); a headless run carries it under any mode.
void main() {
  AgentCli cliFor(
    FakeCliIO io,
